"name":"松竹梅(松竹梅琉騎)","roleCode":"director","roleLabel":"导演","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:220817","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"松竹梅 琉騎","creatorId":"vndb:s1685","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1685","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1685","name":"松竹梅(松竹梅琉騎)","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:220818","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c161803","characterName":"クリスティーナ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c161803"},"originalCharacterName":"クリスティーナ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"“I shall extinguish your evil soul myself.”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The third princess of the Holy Kingdom of Almenan, she is also a swordswoman who has been granted the title of Hero."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her talent with the sword blossomed from a very young age, and unlike her two older sisters, she lacks the refinement typically associated with a princess."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Strongly driven by a sense of duty and justice, she has sworn in her heart that she herself will defeat the demon race and lead the world to peace."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official website."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c161803"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/34/34b42b469865deae8a173cbe46f380cd8d2753012c4ceaea8bda9e178b83e64c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e3/e392e03fbb87139f6b4f08658ac0a8df60c7d4529a2e5793c3019566196a9d43.webp","width":247,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c161804","characterName":"ガルディス","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c161804"},"originalCharacterName":"ガルディス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"“You are my precious way to pass the time—toys that must not be broken.”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The king of the Demon Nation Desraid, and currently the only being known as the Demon King."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Feared by humanity as the root of all evil, he is nonetheless deeply loved by the people of the demon nation."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Beyond his aptitude as a ruler, he excels in both magic and swordsmanship, and in times of war is a fearless champion who leads from the front."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, he also takes pleasure in acting on sudden whims—such as keeping the heroine who came to kill him at his side."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official website."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c161804"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/06/06bc3c76ed865668fd0fcbab49e3f7a69a2451093d728c07bd10ac143a900024.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fd/fd0b32b4f93fde81fcb7d5665e57914549f858e9caf3efadc136a096caecd5b6.webp","width":239,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"凛星凛","creatorId":"vndb:s36678","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s36678","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s36678","name":"凛星凛","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:101960","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c161805","characterName":"レセト","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c161805"},"originalCharacterName":"レセト","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"“Everything I am exists for the princess. If I can protect her, I need nothing else.”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Originally a commoner, he was recognized for his exceptional sword skills and became the heroine’s personal knight."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He swears absolute loyalty to her, placing his mistress above all else in every matter."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In truth, he harbors a secret love for her, but remains steadfast in maintaining his role as her devoted knight."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official website."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c161805"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/81/81b846481fd9387fe7eb7f412090a948c66558ceb99128843dc0ce9279ec46b1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/84/843cdcdda45e37f5b1db5a6c665581ee5bea4f4213f7b1af0b093ddc1c4084d7.webp","width":207,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"佐和 真中","creatorId":"vndb:s864","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s864","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s864","name":"中澤 匡智","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:101958","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c161806","characterName":"ジン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c161806"},"originalCharacterName":"ジン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"“Yes, it’s fine if you hate me. Being liked would be revolting.”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A high-ranking figure of the Demon Nation who serves Demon King Gardis."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Despite his gentle outward appearance, he is dark and calculating within."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He would do anything for Gardis, and if necessary, would trample upon the heroine’s dignity without hesitation."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official website."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c161806"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bd/bd765a2313fd961635f95b414fd237c0d164a7d8c99d8c2f1778e7e81914b9f6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d6/d693c98deaab650a6de1d4bcb320e00b7751f79e896815b3627c11a197bdc81d.webp","width":197,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"三楽 章","creatorId":"vndb:s1399","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1399","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1399","name":"三楽章","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:101959","source":"vndb"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"egs:brand:9171","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:9171","canonicalEntityId":"egs:brand:9171","name":"MU","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"alias-only-review","relationId":"egs:work-brand:40006:9171","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p25760","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p25760","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p25760","name":"Mu","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:158245:v61275","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p25760","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p25760","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p25760","name":"Mu","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:164242:v61275","source":"vndb"}],"missingStates":["confirmed-character-relation-missing","current-runtime-cover-unavailable"],"source":"terminal-wiki-full-runtime-v7"}}
